us B.I.G. \n\nDirected by: Hype Williams\n\nSubscribe to The Notorious B.I.G. channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIZGqIYkST36dLp0uf9o9nw?sub_confirmation=1\n\nThe Notorious B.I.G. - Greatest Hits – https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLhWNDVRwYT0fW95BhmX0nENF232YNxRFI\nThe Notorious B.I.G. - Official Music Videos – https://www.youtube.com/playlist?listPLhWNDVRwYT0eD9n2zzXcP7rnCCjv9wlzD\n\nChristopher Wallace, known professionally as The Notorious B.I.G., Biggie, or Biggie Smalls, was an American rapper and songwriter. He was born in Brooklyn, New York, on May 21, 1972. His debut album Ready to Die was released in September 1994 and included singles such as “Juicy”, “Big Poppa”, and “One More Chance”. Wallace was shot and killed in Los Angeles on March 9, 1997. Two weeks later, his second album, Life After Death, was released posthumously and debuted at No. 1 on the Billboard 200, receiving RIAA Diamond certification. During his career, Biggie received four Grammy nominations, and his catalog remains part of hip hop history.\n\n#TheNotoriousBIG #HipHop #Rap", "channel_id": "UCIZGqIYkST36dLp0uf9o9nw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIZGqIYkST36dLp0uf9o9nw", "duration": 348, "view_count": 130503511, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gUhRKVIjJtw", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["the notorious big", "the notorious big Music Videos", "the notorious big Videos", "the notorious big Songs", "the notorious big playlist", "90s playlist", "90s hip hop", "hip hop", "gangsta rap", "east coast hip hop", "junior mafia", "biggie smalls", "biggie", "Christopher Wallace", "Frank White", "Big Poppa", "mo money mo problems", "mo money mo problems video", "notorious big mo money mo problems", "biggie mo money mo problems", "puff daddy", "mase", "diddy", "p diddy", "B.I.G.", "Diana Ross sample", "I'm Coming Out sample"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality"